  "_comment": "Step 13: custom topics ('My topics'). Used by the Worker (worker/src/custom.js, api.js) and the hourly job (job/custom.py). Edit here, then redeploy the Worker; the job reads it on its next run. max_items_per_topic 8 (not 15): measured, a busy topic like Colombia has 100+ Google results in 2 hours, so the cap decides the cost; 8 new headlines a search is still about 190 a day per topic.",
